# Environment variables (BUG-004 / SECURITY_AUDIT.md Finding 5: this file
# was tracked in git with no gitignore exclusion. Contents were verified
# safe — Supabase publishable/anon key and public project ID/URL only,
# never a secret — but excluding it going forward is correct hygiene
# regardless, so a future genuinely-secret value never gets committed by
# habit. Lovable Cloud injects real environment variables at deploy time
# independent of this file.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

